---
import List from "#/components/ui/List.astro";
import Paragraph from "#/components/ui/Paragraph.astro";
import Section from "#/components/ui/Section.astro";
import Heading from "#/components/ui/Heading.astro";
import IconText from "#/components/ui/IconText.astro";
import Card from "#/components/ui/Card.astro";
---

<Section variant="light">
    <div
        slot="text"
        class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-333 flex-col gap-6 sm:gap-15 xl:flex-row xl:gap-5 xl:pb-8 2xl:gap-25"
    >
        <div class="2xl:w-unset flex flex-col gap-3 xl:w-[45%] xl:pt-2">
            <Heading>
                But what about <em class="text-bubblegum-pink not-italic">privacy?</em>
            </Heading>
            <Paragraph>
                Texts are stripped out of all information except for their content (which is the only thing that this
                bot needs for making memes). This means that usernames and other identifying information is not stored.
                Saved messages are not used for training of AI models or any other purpose rather than to keep the bot
                functional.
            </Paragraph>
            <Paragraph>
                For GIFs and Images we store their link sources, actual files themselves are never saved to <b
                    >Jstmemit</b
                > servers.
            </Paragraph>
            <Paragraph>
                By default the bot is turned off in every channel and will only work in the one where you enable it
                using
                <b> /enable</b>.
            </Paragraph>
            <Paragraph>
                Saved data is automatically deleted after a period of time, however you can always delete yours at any
                moment if you wish to do so using the <b> /settings</b> command
            </Paragraph>

            <List classes="justify-center md:justify-start">
                <IconText
                    icon="https://files.wideunits.nl/jstmemit/images/emojis/gif.svg"
                    alt="gif logo icon"
                    text="GIFs: 90 days"
                />
                <IconText
                    icon="https://files.wideunits.nl/jstmemit/images/emojis/chats.svg"
                    alt="texts icon"
                    text="Texts: 30 days"
                />
                <IconText
                    icon="https://files.wideunits.nl/jstmemit/images/emojis/image.svg"
                    alt="image icon"
                    text="Images: 1 day"
                />
            </List>
        </div>

        <div class="xl:mt-14">
            <ul class="lg:min-h-none relative flex flex-col gap-10 sm:min-h-110">
                <li class="mb-1 font-bold whitespace-nowrap sm:absolute sm:top-10 sm:left-105 lg:text-lg">
                    <p>Your message<br class="hidden sm:block" /> in Discord</p>
                </li>

                <li>
                    <Card classes="p-4 pt-5 max-w-full sm:max-w-fit" label="Discord">
                        <img
                            class="h-22.5 w-auto sm:h-auto sm:w-90"
                            src="https://files.wideunits.nl/jstmemit/images/cocaColaBetterThanPepsi.png"
                            alt="A discord message saying that cola is better than pepsi, has an avatar, username, tag"
                        />
                    </Card>
                </li>

                <li class="absolute top-40 left-10 z-10 hidden min-w-50 sm:block lg:left-23">
                    <img src="https://files.wideunits.nl/jstmemit/images/arrowBent.svg" alt="pink arrow" />
                </li>

                <li class="mb-1 font-bold whitespace-nowrap sm:absolute sm:top-70 sm:left-0 lg:left-8 lg:text-lg">
                    <p>Only text content, <br class="hidden sm:block" />no usernames</p>
                </li>

                <li class="sm:absolute sm:top-49 sm:left-40 lg:left-55">
                    <Card classes="p-4 pt-5" label="Stored">
                        <pre
                            class="min-h-auto font-mono text-xs sm:w-auto sm:text-sm">
<span class="text-golden">{`{`}</span>
    <span class="text-hot-fuchsia">[</span>
        <span class="text-dark-cyan">"<span class="text-white">Coca cola is better than pepsi</span>"</span>,
        <span class="text-dark-cyan">"<span class="text-white">and fanta</span>"</span>
    <span class="text-hot-fuchsia">]</span>
<span class="text-golden">{`}`}</span></pre>
                    </Card>
                    <p class="mx-auto mt-4 mr-4 text-center font-medium sm:hidden">
                        Used for memes in <br class="hidden sm:block" />the same channel
                    </p>
                </li>

                <li
                    class="absolute top-98 left-90 -mt-3 hidden w-full font-bold whitespace-nowrap sm:block lg:left-100 lg:text-lg"
                >
                    <p>Used for memes in <br />the same channel</p>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</Section>
